From e64aac3dd9d0b72ba2dc48a1ee7037973fc6b77b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Felipe=20Zipitr=C3=ADa?=
 <3012076+fzipi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:21:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(932260): drop REQUEST_FILENAME to stop false positives on
 URL paths (lts/v4.25.x) (#4843)

Cherry-pick of #4842. 932260 matches command words at the start of a
value, which in a path matches ordinary slugs such as
/recipes/chef-salad. Commands that follow a shell metacharacter in the
path are still detected at PL1 by 932235.
